Task 2: Data Visualization and Storytelling
Objective

To analyze business performance and present insights through effective visualizations that support data-driven decision making.

Dashboard Title
Business Performance Dashboard (Jan 2025 - Jun 2025)
Overview

This dashboard analyzes sales growth, regional performance, product contribution, and profitability over six months. The visualizations provide a clear picture of business expansion and highlight key drivers of success.

Visualization 1: Sales Growth Trend

Chart Type: Line Chart

Purpose

To show how sales changed over time.

Insight
Sales increased consistently from $120K in January to $260K in June.
Growth accelerated during the second quarter (April to June).
No decline was observed during the period.
Key Takeaway

📈 Strong and sustained sales growth indicates increasing market demand and successful business strategies.

